-# The group's cover at card size, in the 16:10 frame the settings form crops
-# uploads to. One of three things: an uploaded image, a preset from
-# Redesign::GroupArt, or a monogram for a group with no art at all.
-#
-# A partial because the group index card, the teacher's hero and the student's
-# lore card had all grown the identical branch; the deck and the octagon thumb
-# ask the same question through gh_group_cover but draw their own box.
- cover = gh_group_cover(story_group)

.gh-art{ class: ('gh-art--mono' if cover.nil?) }
  = cover || gh_monogram(story_group.name)
